{"seq":3,"slug":"multilayer-board-design","title":"多层板设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/multilayer-board-design","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多层板设计\">多层板设计</h1><p>随着电路复杂度提升和信号频率增长，双层板已无法满足高速数字系统的需求。多层板通过增加内部铜层，提供完整的参考平面、更短的互连路径和更好的 EMI 屏蔽。叠层设计是多层 PCB 工程的核心决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>多层板</strong>：通过在板内增加铜层，提供完整参考平面、更短互连路径与更好 EMI 屏蔽</li>\n<li><strong>叠层（Stack-up）</strong>：层的功能、顺序与介质厚度的组合，决定阻抗与回流路径</li>\n<li><strong>参考平面</strong>：信号层紧邻的 GND 或 PWR 平面，为回流提供低阻抗路径</li>\n<li><strong>对称性原则</strong>：以板中心为轴上下对称，防止层压后翘曲</li>\n<li><strong>HDI</strong>：用微孔实现更高布线密度的工艺，按微孔层数分为多个等级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"层数选择依据\">层数选择依据</h2><h3 id=\"层数决策因素\">层数决策因素</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>影响方向</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号频率</td>\n<td>频率越高需要更多层</td>\n<td>高速信号需相邻参考平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引脚密度</td>\n<td>BGA 高密度需更多布线层</td>\n<td>扇出通道数限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电源域数量</td>\n<td>每增加电压域需额外层</td>\n<td>独立电源平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EMC 要求</td>\n<td>高 EMC 要求需更多屏蔽层</td>\n<td>屏蔽和回流控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>板面积约束</td>\n<td>面积受限需向Z轴扩展</td>\n<td>层数替代面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本预算</td>\n<td>层数越多成本越高</td>\n<td>非线性增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"典型应用层数\">典型应用层数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n<th>推荐层数</th>\n<th>典型叠层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单控制器</td>\n<td>2层</td>\n<td>Sig-Sig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般消费电子</td>\n<td>4层</td>\n<td>Sig-GND-PWR-Sig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业控制/通信</td>\n<td>6层</td>\n<td>Sig-GND-Sig-Sig-PWR-Sig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高速数字（DDR4/5）</td>\n<td>8层</td>\n<td>Sig-GND-Sig-PWR-GND-Sig-GND-Sig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务器/网络设备</td>\n<td>10–16层</td>\n<td>多信号层+多参考平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FPGA/ASIC 基板</td>\n<td>16–24层</td>\n<td>HDI + 高层数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"叠层设计原则\">叠层设计原则</h2><h3 id=\"核心规则\">核心规则</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[叠层设计原则] --&gt; B[对称性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[信号层紧邻参考平面]&#10;    A --&gt; D[高速信号夹于GND平面间]&#10;    A --&gt; E[电源/地平面紧耦合]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[防止翘曲&lt;br&gt;应力对称]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[阻抗可控&lt;br&gt;回流路径明确]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[带状线结构&lt;br&gt;屏蔽效果好]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[天然去耦电容&lt;br&gt;高频储能]\">graph TD\n    A[叠层设计原则] --&gt; B[对称性]\n    A --&gt; C[信号层紧邻参考平面]\n    A --&gt; D[高速信号夹于GND平面间]\n    A --&gt; E[电源/地平面紧耦合]\n    B --&gt; B1[防止翘曲&lt;br&gt;应力对称]\n    C --&gt; C1[阻抗可控&lt;br&gt;回流路径明确]\n    D --&gt; D1[带状线结构&lt;br&gt;屏蔽效果好]\n    E --&gt; E1[天然去耦电容&lt;br&gt;高频储能]</pre><p>叠层设计的五大原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对称性</strong>：以板中心为轴，上下层对称分布（材料、铜厚一致），防止层压后翘曲</li>\n<li><strong>参考平面紧邻</strong>：每个信号层必须紧邻一个完整的参考平面（GND 或 PWR）</li>\n<li><strong>带状线优先</strong>：高速信号优先使用带状线结构（夹在两个平面之间）</li>\n<li><strong>电源-地耦合</strong>：PWR 和 GND 平面相邻且介质薄（≤0.1mm），形成大面积去耦电容</li>\n<li><strong>表层微带线</strong>：中低速信号可使用外层微带线结构</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"经典四层板叠层\">经典四层板叠层</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层号</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>铜厚</th>\n<th>介质厚度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>信号+元件</td>\n<td>1oz (35μm)</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>微带线，元件侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0.2mm</td>\n<td>FR4 芯板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>GND</td>\n<td>1oz</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>完整接地平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prepreg</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>1.0mm</td>\n<td>半固化片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>PWR</td>\n<td>1oz</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>电源平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0.2mm</td>\n<td>FR4 芯板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>信号+元件</td>\n<td>1oz</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>微带线，焊接侧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"八层板高速叠层\">八层板高速叠层</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层号</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>相邻介质</th>\n<th>信号类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>Signal</td>\n<td>3.5mil PP</td>\n<td>中低速信号、元件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>GND</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>完整参考平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>Signal</td>\n<td>5mil Core</td>\n<td>高速信号（带状线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>PWR</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>电源平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5</td>\n<td>GND</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>接地平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L6</td>\n<td>Signal</td>\n<td>5mil Core</td>\n<td>高速信号（带状线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L7</td>\n<td>GND</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>完整参考平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L8</td>\n<td>Signal</td>\n<td>3.5mil PP</td>\n<td>中低速信号、元件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"材料选择\">材料选择</h2><h3 id=\"pcb-基材对比\">PCB 基材对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>介电常数(Dk)</th>\n<th>损耗角正切(Df)</th>\n<th>适用频率</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FR4 标准</td>\n<td>4.2–4.5</td>\n<td>0.020–0.025</td>\n<td>&lt;3GHz</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中 Tg FR4</td>\n<td>4.2–4.4</td>\n<td>0.018–0.022</td>\n<td>&lt;5GHz</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高速 FR4</td>\n<td>3.8–4.0</td>\n<td>0.008–0.012</td>\n<td>&lt;10GHz</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rogers 4350B</td>\n<td>3.48</td>\n<td>0.004</td>\n<td>&lt;20GHz</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Megtron 6</td>\n<td>3.4</td>\n<td>0.002</td>\n<td>&lt;50GHz</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PTFE (Teflon)</td>\n<td>2.1–2.5</td>\n<td>0.001</td>\n<td>&gt;20GHz</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>材料选择依据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>信号最高频率决定 Df 上限</li>\n<li>Dk 一致性影响阻抗控制精度</li>\n<li>高 Tg（&gt;170°C）适用于无铅焊接</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"hdi-技术\">HDI 技术</h2><h3 id=\"hdi-分级\">HDI 分级</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>HDI 等级</th>\n<th>微孔层数</th>\n<th>叠孔方式</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Type I</td>\n<td>1层微孔</td>\n<td>1+N+1</td>\n<td>手机、平板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type II</td>\n<td>2层微孔</td>\n<td>2+N+2</td>\n<td>高端消费电子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type III</td>\n<td>≥3层微孔</td>\n<td>3+N+3</td>\n<td>网络设备、服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Any-layer</td>\n<td>全层微孔</td>\n<td>任意层互连</td>\n<td>旗舰手机、芯片封装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"hdi-设计规则\">HDI 设计规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>标准 PCB</th>\n<th>HDI</th>\n<th>Any-layer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小线宽</td>\n<td>4mil</td>\n<td>3mil</td>\n<td>2mil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小间距</td>\n<td>4mil</td>\n<td>3mil</td>\n<td>2mil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微孔直径</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0.1mm</td>\n<td>0.075mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焊盘直径</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0.25mm</td>\n<td>0.2mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纵横比</td>\n<td>10:1</td>\n<td>0.75:1</td>\n<td>0.5:1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阻抗叠层计算\">阻抗叠层计算</h2><h3 id=\"微带线阻抗\">微带线阻抗</h3><p>外层走线（只有一个参考平面）的特征阻抗近似公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>87</mn><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1.41</mn></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5.98</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_0 = \\frac{87}{\\sqrt{\\varepsilon_r + 1.41}} \\times \\ln\\left(\\frac{5.98h}{0.8w + t}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2514em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2778em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.41</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">87</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5.98</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 为介质厚度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 为线宽，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为铜厚，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为介电常数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"带状线阻抗\">带状线阻抗</h3><p>内层走线（两侧各有一个参考平面）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><msqrt><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.67</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_0 = \\frac{60}{\\sqrt{\\varepsilon_r}} \\times \\ln\\left(\\frac{4b}{0.67\\pi(0.8w + t)}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3222em;vertical-align:-1.0007em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6853em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0007em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.67</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为两参考平面间距。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阻抗设计流程\">阻抗设计流程</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>确定目标阻抗（50Ω/90Ω/100Ω）</td>\n<td>接口标准文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>选择叠层结构和介质厚度</td>\n<td>板厂叠层能力表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>使用 2D 场求解器计算线宽</td>\n<td>Polar SI9000 / Saturn PCB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>验证制造公差内阻抗范围</td>\n<td>Monte Carlo 分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>与板厂确认可制造性</td>\n<td>叠层审签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"层间跳转策略\">层间跳转策略</h2><h3 id=\"过孔换层规则\">过孔换层规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参考平面一致</td>\n<td>换层前后参考同一 GND 平面</td>\n<td>回流路径连续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>就近回流过孔</td>\n<td>信号过孔旁 ≤50mil 放 GND 过孔</td>\n<td>减小回流环路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免跨分割</td>\n<td>不跨越电源平面分割线</td>\n<td>防止回流中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最少换层</td>\n<td>高速信号换层 ≤2 次</td>\n<td>减少阻抗不连续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多层板设计是高可靠、高性能 PCB 的基础架构。从层数选择到叠层结构、从材料选型到 HDI 工艺，每个决策都直接影响信号质量、EMC 表现和制造成本。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>层数由信号频率、引脚密度、电源域数量与成本共同决定</li>\n<li>叠层遵循对称性、参考平面紧邻、带状线优先、电源-地紧耦合等原则</li>\n<li>材料选择以最高频率定 Df 上限，以 Dk 一致性保障阻抗精度</li>\n<li>HDI 用微孔提升密度，代价是更高的工艺成本</li>\n<li>阻抗计算依赖 2D 场求解器，并与板厂叠层能力反复确认</li>\n<li>层间跳转须保持参考一致，并在换层过孔旁就近放置回流过孔</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多层板设计","id":"多层板设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"层数选择依据","id":"层数选择依据"},{"level":3,"text":"层数决策因素","id":"层数决策因素"},{"level":3,"text":"典型应用层数","id":"典型应用层数"},{"level":2,"text":"叠层设计原则","id":"叠层设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"核心规则","id":"核心规则"},{"level":3,"text":"经典四层板叠层","id":"经典四层板叠层"},{"level":3,"text":"八层板高速叠层","id":"八层板高速叠层"},{"level":2,"text":"材料选择","id":"材料选择"},{"level":3,"text":"PCB 基材对比","id":"pcb-基材对比"},{"level":2,"text":"HDI 技术","id":"hdi-技术"},{"level":3,"text":"HDI 分级","id":"hdi-分级"},{"level":3,"text":"HDI 设计规则","id":"hdi-设计规则"},{"level":2,"text":"阻抗叠层计算","id":"阻抗叠层计算"},{"level":3,"text":"微带线阻抗","id":"微带线阻抗"},{"level":3,"text":"带状线阻抗","id":"带状线阻抗"},{"level":3,"text":"阻抗设计流程","id":"阻抗设计流程"},{"level":2,"text":"层间跳转策略","id":"层间跳转策略"},{"level":3,"text":"过孔换层规则","id":"过孔换层规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"走线策略与铜皮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/routing-strategies-copper"},"next":{"title":"阻抗控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/impedance-control"}}